{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'git status --short --branch'","aggregated_output":"git: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-WqZbXT7u' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-23 10:18:58.989 xcodebuild[23903:76239138]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-23 10:18:59.137 xcodebuild[23903:76239137] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-Mhmc4Mct' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-23 10:18:59.527 xcodebuild[23905:76239160]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-23 10:18:59.648 xcodebuild[23905:76239155] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n## clean-arch\n M docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\n M docs/DECISIONS-log.md\n M docs/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
